<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;"><font style="">I want to take a moment to thank you for the opportunity to serve as your Insperity Onboarding Specialist. I know the transition process can feel overwhelming at times and I hope we have made you feel at ease throughout. In order to make sure we are providing the highest level of service possible, we will be sending you a brief survey and I would love to hear your feedback.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: left;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left;">Now that your transition is complete, your dedicated Insperity&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);">Client Liaison/</span><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255); color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 12pt;">HR Specialist</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;is ready to serve as your main point of contact and will reach out to schedule a welcome and introduction call. If you need assistance sooner or have any questions, outside of payroll, please direct them to:</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: left;"><br></div><font style=""><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Insperity&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; background-color: rgb(102, 255, 255);">Client Liaison</span></div></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255);">CL NAME&nbsp;</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255);">CL EMAIL</span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: start;"><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Insperity&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; text-align: start;">HR Specialist</span></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">HRS NAME&nbsp;</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="background-color: rgb(51, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">HRS EMAIL</span></div></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><br></div></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="text-align: left;">Once again, it has been a pleasure to serve you and I wish you all the best!</div></span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
